      "month": "May 2026"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many thanks to Rich Valley Landscaping LLC for refreshing several areas of our landscaping plus weeding and mulching our yard. We had planned to add low-voltage lighting, but Brandon suggested we use solar lights instead. That saved us a lot of money!",
